  "title": "WASMOS Demo — MUSHRA",
  "instructions": "For each item you will hear a labeled Reference sound, plus several unlabeled sounds — these may include a hidden copy of the reference itself and a hidden low-quality anchor, used to screen listener reliability. Play the reference as often as you like, then play and rate each unlabeled sound from 0 (bad) to 100 (excellent) relative to the reference.",
